OL,3,AGoogle picks Finland for its largest
OL,4,Asingle investment in Europe
OL,5,
OL,6,FGoogle will buy up to half the
OL,7,Felectricity produced by one of
OL,8,FFinland's nuclear power plants as part
OL,9,Fof a record bB,13bn (#11bn; $15bn)
OL,10,Finvestment in the country's AI
OL,11,Finfrastructure, the company announced.
OL,13,FThe US tech giant said the package
OL,14,Fwould fund three new data centres,
OL,15,Fexpand an existing site and support
OL,16,Fenergy projects to power growing demand
OL,17,Ffor AI services.
